1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,060
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 16=

12
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,800
Grand Shaman.

13
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,680
Why have you summoned me
so late, Grand Shaman?

14
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,240
What is it?

15
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,800
Diviner Song,

16
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,920
I know

17
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,000
it's been hard on you lately.

18
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,600
What do you mean, Grand Shaman?

19
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,160
You have to watch over Li

20
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,920
and protect Jinan City, too.

21
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,960
Carrying this secret in your heart

22
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,320
life after life

23
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,600
must be exhausting.

24
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,080
You actually knew?

25
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,160
I knew.

26
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,480
As a shamaness,

27
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,240
I can see the future,

28
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:12,480
but I can't see the outcome.

29
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,280
A thousand cycles,

30
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,720
a thousand outcomes.

31
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,560
I don't know what outcome

32
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:21,280
awaits us in this life.

33
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:22,800
In my previous life,

34
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,040
I made her leave Jinan City,

35
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,080
thinking I could stop all of this.

36
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,640
I never thought

37
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,400
she would come back in the end.

38
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,240
In this life,

39
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,280
I must stay by her side

40
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,640
until the very last moment

41
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,920
and watch her leave Jinan City
with my own eyes.

42
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:45,480
This is my only chance.

43
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:49,760
Grand Shaman!

44
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,800
How can this be?

45
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,040
It's just my inner demon.

46
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:56,360
Nothing serious.

47
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,400
Diviner Song,

48
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,080
though I lead the Shaman Clan,

49
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,880
I'm also a selfish mother.

50
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,680
In that case,

51
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,120
we will

52
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,560
protect Jinan City.

53
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,160
But promise me

54
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,880
you'll make sure

55
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:20,800
Li stays alive.

56
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,240
(Song Ziyuan,)

57
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,640
(I don't want to care
about anyone else anymore.)

58
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,000
(But I want you to live.)

59
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,320
You...

60
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,320
I'm going to die in the end anyway.

61
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,880
Why bother with all this?

62
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,240
What if you do survive in the end?

63
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,600
This lamp oil should last
another two months.

64
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,600
If the Qin Army massacres the people
in the city

65
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,720
and you somehow escape,

66
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,600
remember to come find me.

67
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:52,440
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

68
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,160
Okay.

69
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,800
You have to promise me

70
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,080
you'll stay alive.

71
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,560
I'm abandoning you all and running away.

72
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,840
Of course I'll stay alive.

73
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:07,290
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

74
00:05:07,290 --> 00:05:14,260
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

75
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,280
Song Ziyuan,

76
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:21,240
can't you admit, just once,

77
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,360
that you can't bear to let me go?

78
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:28,140
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

79
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:31,650
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

80
00:05:31,650 --> 00:05:35,010
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

81
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,680
Li...

82
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:42,050
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

83
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,360
You're not drunk this time.

84
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,160
You can't deny it now.

85
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:49,730
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

86
00:05:49,730 --> 00:05:56,020
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

87
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,760
Li,

88
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,160
promise me

89
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,760
you will leave Jinan City.

90
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,680
Okay.

91
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,480
I promise.

92
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,360
There's half a month left.

93
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,040
No going back on your word.

94
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,200
Okay.

95
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,560
What a pity.

96
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,240
Every time we meet,

97
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,480
we're one meeting closer to goodbye.

98
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:25,880
No.

99
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:27,800
Every time we meet,

100
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,160
that's one more time together.

101
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:36,760
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

102
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,680
Song Ziyuan,

103
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,560
now,

104
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:43,360
can you love me properly,
just this once?

105
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:45,600
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

106
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:52,280
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

107
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:56,260
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

108
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:59,780
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

109
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,760
Why are you up so early?

110
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,440
Feeling better?

111
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,000
It's just a little blood.

112
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,480
Nothing to worry about.

113
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,040
I'm worried.

114
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,680
Song Ziyuan,

115
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,320
how come you seem like
a different person?

116
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,600
You're such a...

117
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,520
Such a what?

118
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,280
Don't you like it, Li?

119
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,280
They're all laughing at me.

120
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,200
Then let's go back to our room

121
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,160
and not let them see.

122
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,200
Shut up.

123
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,280
What's wrong?

124
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,040
Master.

125
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:01,760
Turn around.

126
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,600
Okay.

127
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,720
We just caught a thief at the residence.

128
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,200
He says he's here for his wife.

129
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,440
We didn't dare deal with him,

130
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,680
so I came to report to you.

131
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,240
Why...

132
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,800
Why did you arrest me?

133
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,160
Diviner Song.

134
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,880
It's you?

135
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,800
Diviner Song, I...

136
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:33,080
I want to take my wife home.

137
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:37,000
Didn't you drive her out?

138
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,560
Why come for her now?

139
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,080
I was just impulsive back then.

140
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:44,200
Now I know I was wrong.

141
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,680
She's about to give birth.

142
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,040
I feel

143
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,560
really worried.

144
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:51,720
Please, Diviner Song,

145
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,840
let me take her back.

146
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,960
Mrs. Zhao is recovering here.

147
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,360
After she gives birth,

148
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,600
if she's willing to return,

149
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:03,840
we will

150
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,520
naturally send her back.

151
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:07,880
But...

152
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,680
But I'm her husband.

153
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,080
When she gives birth,

154
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,000
I should be by her side.

155
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,480
I haven't seen

156
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,800
you care about her this much.

157
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,760
You two must still be holding

158
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,240
what happened last time against me.

159
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,560
But this time,

160
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,280
I truly want to take her home.

161
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:28,360
Ying is my wife, after all.

162
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,440
Diviner Song,

163
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,200
you wouldn't deliberately
keep her, would you?

164
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,960
Mrs. Zhao doesn't want to go with you.

165
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:36,880
Leave.

166
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,680
Why doesn't she want to leave with me?

167
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,960
Miss,

168
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,640
at least let me see my wife.

169
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,840
Otherwise, after so long with no news,

170
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:47,480
I might suspect
you've done something to her.

171
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:48,480
You...

172
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,600
If you don't leave,

173
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,880
do you want me to throw you out?

174
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:54,960
Diviner Song,

175
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:57,360
you... You're bullying us

176
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,400
powerless common folk!

177
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:00,880
So what if I am?

178
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:02,800
Get out!

179
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,160
If he leaves like this,

180
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,440
won't he spread rumors

181
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,440
and hurt your reputation?

182
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,240
At a time like this,

183
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:18,920
why would I still worry
about such things?

184
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:21,960
However,

185
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,800
his visit today is suspicious.

186
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:27,080
Why would he suddenly want her back?

187
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,160
Autumn has come.

188
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:48,800
Yes.

189
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,480
You should put on another layer.

190
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,160
It's going to snow soon.

191
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,240
The snow in Jinan City

192
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:06,400
isn't beautiful.

193
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,240
You know what?

194
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,880
When you died saving me,

195
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:15,920
I seemed to see things

196
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,400
I'd never seen before.

197
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:19,400
What did you see?

198
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:22,880
I saw

199
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,520
us falling in love,

200
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,000
then getting married,

201
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,080
then parting.

202
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,880
It felt as if we'd lived a whole life

203
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,480
in another time and place.

204
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,360
Shamanesses have the gift of foresight.

205
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,520
Perhaps what I saw

206
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,200
is what's yet to come.

207
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,880
In ten days, I'm leaving.

208
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:56,800
Song Ziyuan,

209
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,160
let's get married.

210
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:04,680
Li,

211
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:07,240
I can't agree to that.

212
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:11,400
You...

213
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,120
Are you afraid

214
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,400
I won't want to leave?

215
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,200
Then you should say yes

216
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,520
and fulfill my wish.

217
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,160
That way,

218
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,600
I can leave Jinan City

219
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,880
without any regrets.

220
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,680
Song Ziyuan,

221
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,280
don't you want to marry me?

222
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,680
Of course I do.

223
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:42,480
But...

224
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,080
But what?

225
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,200
Song Ziyuan,

226
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,720
how can a grown man like you be so...

227
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,160
so indecisive?

228
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,960
Do you want to marry me or not?

229
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,680
I do.

230
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:15,440
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

231
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:19,550
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

232
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:21,480
♪You come treading through snow♪

233
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:27,020
♪Twin butterfly shadows in my palm♪

234
00:13:27,020 --> 00:13:31,200
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

235
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:35,110
♪Yet one passionate look undoes it all♪

236
00:13:35,110 --> 00:13:37,520
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

237
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:43,200
♪I'd burn through every lifetime
to be with you♪

238
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:47,430
♪Countless blades and a river of stars
fall into your cool gaze♪

239
00:13:47,430 --> 00:13:51,520
♪An echo of our first meeting
at the edge of chaos♪

240
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,180
♪Like vines, love♪

241
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:58,820
♪Brews the years
into moonlight in your eyes♪

242
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,200
Chu Li.

243
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,440
Fusheng, what's wrong?

244
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:08,640
You...

245
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:09,800
You two...

246
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:14,200
We two...

247
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,760
Chu Li,

248
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,800
you won't leave me alone, will you?

249
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:21,840
Of course not.

250
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:22,960
You're like a little brother to me.

251
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,480
I won't leave you behind.

252
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:26,760
Will Diviner Song

253
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,280
leave Jinan City with us?

254
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:29,560
No.

255
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,080
Song Ziyuan won't leave.

256
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,360
That's great.

257
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,360
Fusheng,

258
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:37,320
I don't care what you're thinking,

259
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,400
but you must take good care of Li.

260
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:41,680
Chu Li, he calls you Li.

261
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:44,480
So what?

262
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:46,650
Humph.

263
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,200
Anyway, when the time comes,

264
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,160
I'll be the only one by her side.

265
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,200
Stop it.

266
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,520
Why are you bickering with a young boy?

267
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,080
Who's there?

268
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,720
Guards!

269
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:21,760
Diviner Song?

270
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:22,760
Why are you here?

271
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:23,720
This is the royal palace.

272
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,000
How dare you trespass?

273
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:25,840
Guards!

274
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,840
- Guards!
- Stop calling.

275
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,240
No one outside can hear you.

276
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,480
What are you going to do?

277
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,480
I am the King's woman!

278
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:35,760
Beautiful Lady Lan,

279
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:37,080
drop the act.

280
00:15:40,310 --> 00:15:47,050
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

281
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:54,130
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

282
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:57,830
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

283
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,200
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

284
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:08,180
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

285
00:16:08,610 --> 00:16:15,260
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

286
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:21,920
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
